      "text": "Captain Robert Gray named the sheltered waterway Bullfinch Harbor on May 7, 1792, before later renaming it Grays Harbor.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
